<title>USA: Nebco Evans Holding Co sells 144a notes.</title>
<headline>Nebco Evans Holding Co sells 144a notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144a debt issue from Nebco Evans Holding Company was priced Wednesday via sole manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities Corp, according to a market source. BORROWER NEBCO EVANS HOLDING COMPANY AMT $55 MLN (PRCDS) COUPON 5YR ZERO   MATURITY 7/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR DISC NOTES ISS PRICE 54.788  FIRST PAY DATE N/A LAST MOODY'S CAA1   YIELD 12.375 PCT  PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS    SPREAD 611 BPS     AFTER 1/15/2003</p>
<p>						  CALLABLE  NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
